notes = "The actual observed SteamCloud spatial UUID owns this prepared maintained source, independently of the optional water-vaporization study. Its exact current 1–32 admitted cells construct and update the source; capacity overflow refuses rather than truncating or adding cells. Constructor fields replace the three review cells and retire_at4s with actual cells and unknown-future infinity. The declared retirement_time setter observes only the existing native owner lifetime, and actual owner removal tears down immediately; neither the source4.8s inspection end nor the native two-round rules are replayed as a client timer. The prepared bank excludes cells and retirement from its immutable emission shape. No density field, live-particle packet, imagined vaporization contact or new gameplay cloud is required. Source assignment only; native output qualification and all artwork review remain open."
